              "backend": "anthropic",
              "normalization_notes": [],
              "raw_id": "ev03",
              "source": "model",
              "source_chunk_id": null
            }
          ],
          "quote": "If\nnot for the glare of city lights on Earth, we wouldn't have had to move\nour telescopes to the Moon. If not for the gravel falling out of the\nsky on the Moon, making it necessary to resurface the reflectors every\nweek, we wouldn't have had to move to Mars."
